{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"734864101892685976","content":"Web kneels in front of Victor. They pull from beneath their cloak their magic focus, which is a spider bursting with fungus preserved in amber, and hold it in front of Victor's eyes. \"I too am no stranger to death and its reversal. My dearest wish is that we resolve the rest of this peacefully and never bother each other again.\"","created_at":"2020-07-23T21:14:38.917000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735968142995488899","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
