{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"734864101892685976","content":"Leaf thinks for a moment, remembering 🎵's anger last time they were here. \"While I think things have gotten out of hand,\" she eyes goose, \"What my friends and I saw in that crate was a creature in pain. We- I don't want him to be in pain anymore.\"","created_at":"2020-07-23T21:20:19.129000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-23T21:20:42.066000Z","id":"735969569948303410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
